sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Party as Citizen hoac Recycler
    participant UI as EcoLink Web UI
    participant CmpCtrl as ComplaintsController
    participant RcpCtrl as HandoverReceiptController
    participant CmpSvc as ComplaintService
    participant RcpSvc as HandoverReceiptService
    participant R2 as Cloudflare R2 Storage
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 16

    Note over Party,DB: U-11: Upload anh bang chung R2 va gui phieu khieu nai 2 chieu (hoac qua Dispute bien nhan)

    opt Dinh kem anh bang chung toi da 5 anh (BR-DSP-02)
        Party->>UI: Chon anh can dien tu / bien lai / diem hen NoShow
        UI->>CmpCtrl: POST /api/v1/complaints/upload-evidence (multipart/form-data)
        CmpCtrl->>CmpSvc: UploadEvidenceAsync(stream, fileName, contentType)
        CmpSvc->>R2: PutObject AWS4-HMAC-SHA256 (complaint-evidences/yyyy/MM/...)
        R2-->>UI: 200 OK fileUrl & objectKey
    end

    alt Luong 1: Gui truc tiep qua cong Khieu nai 2 chieu
        Party->>UI: Chon don, nhom loi & mo ta >= 15 ky tu
        UI->>CmpCtrl: POST /api/v1/complaints
        CmpCtrl->>CmpSvc: SubmitComplaintAsync(callerId, request)
        CmpSvc->>DB: Verify thanh vien don + han 7 ngay + check uq_transaction_complaints_active_request
        alt Ngoai don (403) / Qua 7 ngay (400) / Trung phieu dang mo (409)
            CmpSvc-->>UI: Tra ma loi BR-DSP-01 (MSG-DSP-03 hoac MSG-DSP-04)
        else Hop le
            CmpSvc->>DB: INSERT transaction_complaints (CMP-yyyyMMdd-XXXX, Open) + Sync Disputed neu Awaiting
            CmpSvc->>DB: SyncHandoverToTradeOrderAsync (chat he thong)
            CmpSvc-->>UI: 201 Created MSG-DSP-01
        end
    else Luong 2: Citizen khieu nai ngay tren man hinh Bien nhan (U-09)
        Party->>RcpCtrl: POST /api/v1/handover-requests/{id}/receipt/dispute
        RcpCtrl->>RcpSvc: DisputeAsync(userId, requestId, request)
        RcpSvc->>DB: UPDATE handover_requests = Disputed + INSERT transaction_complaints (ScaleDiscrepancy, Open)
        RcpCtrl-->>UI: 200 OK MSG-DSP-01 (da chuyen hang doi S-05)
    end

    Party->>UI: Xem lich su "Khieu nai cua toi" (all / submitted / against)
    UI->>CmpCtrl: GET /api/v1/complaints/me
    CmpSvc->>DB: Filter ComplainantId == userId OR RespondentId == userId (BR-DSP-06)
    CmpSvc-->>UI: 200 OK PagedResult ComplaintSummaryDto
